  "notes": "{受信|じゅしん} means receiving signals, messages, or broadcasts. Composed of {受|じゅ} (receive) + {信|しん} (message/signal).\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {受信|じゅしん}する: to receive\n- {受信|じゅしん}ボックス/{受信|じゅしん}トレイ: inbox\n- {受信|じゅしん}{拒否|きょひ}: blocking (messages), rejection of reception\n- {電波|でんぱ}{受信|じゅしん}: signal reception\n\nTECHNICAL TERMS:\n- {受信|じゅしん}{機|き}: receiver (device)\n- {受信|じゅしん}{感度|かんど}: reception sensitivity\n- {受信|じゅしん}{状態|じょうたい}: reception status/quality\n- {受信|じゅしん}{料|りょう}: reception fee (e.g., NHK TV fee)\n\nOPPOSITE:\n- {発信|はっしん}: transmission, sending",
